# CKA Drill: etcd Snapshot Backup & Restore (`etcd`)

Practice the etcd v3 snapshot lifecycle, TLS credential discovery, and data-dir restore on the Kubernetes control plane.

## Exam Importance & Principles

- **Exam Domain**: Cluster Architecture, Installation & Configuration (25%).
- **Frequency**: Present in nearly every CKA exam session.
- **Key Habit**: Never memorize certificate paths; always extract them directly from the static pod manifest at `/etc/kubernetes/manifests/etcd.yaml`.
- **API Version**: Always set `ETCDCTL_API=3` (or rely on the system-wide profile export).

